DESCRIPTION:JULY 11TH 2026 // LOW BALL YOUR LANDLORD FEST VOL I The ruling class looks after its own interests. Let’s look after ours. Come to the gig and support : @op.otd.mtl : a pan-canadian org dedicated to neighbourhood class struggle. @slam.matu : the Montreal Autonomous Tenants Union @foodagainstfascismmtl : A grassroots collective that runs weekly food distributions for the people @cacv.verdun your favorite local tenant rights association giving free legal information for tenants since 1970. (more to be announced soon) COMMUNITY BBQ 5pm-7pm Family friendly BBQ with an auction and political collectives tabling so attendees can ask questions and get implicated FUNDRAISER SHOW // 7pm-11pm // 20$ PWYC // 1900 rue Le Ber // ALL AGES DOORS : 7pm SHOW : 7:30pm SHARP. NO PUNK TIME. The political collectives will continue to table ; food will be served by @foodagainstfascismmtl with speeches from community organizers Jahanam Channeler @o__b__e__l__i__s__k @jetsammtl FROM AGITATED TO MOBILIZED ! Flyer by @rileyxkaram
